      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“当然啰。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Of course.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03019",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "这是不同的棋风嘛。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is simply a different style of play.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03019",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "唉，围棋是阴郁的玩意儿，令人感到不明朗。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Ah, go is a gloomy sort of thing, and it leaves one feeling that matters are unclear.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03019",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "这个明朗不明朗，当然与胜负无关。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Whether it feels clear or unclear, of course, has nothing to do with winning or losing.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03019",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "这并不是说大竹先生变弱了……”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That is not to say that Mr. Otake has grown weaker...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
